{"receipt_id":"receipt_721d77aaf5ce4b96acbea469e1a6a934","provider_request_id":null,"attempt_id":"attempt_fcc32bbc42464f9caf4f58f7bda49674","neuron_id":"neuron_051dc2d1123a4742b0cca75dcbcb6362","role_id":"REASONING","adapter":"kilo-gateway","provider":"kilo-gateway","model":"poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free","model_family":"laguna","credential_handle":null,"started_at":"2026-10-14T04:29:31.056514Z","finished_at":"2026-10-14T04:29:35.553046Z","success":true,"output":"The claim states that under the GDPR, a controller must notify a personal data breach to the supervisory authority within 48 hours of becoming aware of it, where feasible.\n\nAccording to Article 33(1) of the GDPR, the controller must notify the personal data breach to the supervisory authority \"without undue delay and, where feasible, not later than 72 hours after having become aware of it.\" This means the timeframe is 72 hours, not 48 hours as claimed in the prompt. The claim is therefore incorrect regarding the specific timeframe.\n\nVerdict: REFUTED\nKEY: 72 hours","failure_class":null,"failure_message":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":733,"output_tokens":132,"total_tokens":865,"cost_usd":0.0},"fallback_level":0,"metadata":{"status_code":200,"protocol":"OPENAI_CHAT","rate_headers":{},"provider_reported_model":"poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free","system_fingerprint":null,"finish_reason":"stop","routed_via":null,"effective_skill_ids":["reasoning"],"required_skill_ids":[],"authority_lease_id":"lease_b5e47dc725cb451ba1add9b38d130a75","skill_prompt_sha256":"5c557a00dfeb1b3f8638a4e6d71bab2d1aef306bec5b4dad5ee15b23971d945d","requested_model":"poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free","model_fingerprint":"e5473f10dd055c1a","provider_request_id":null,"credential_attempts":[],"provider_attempted":true,"provider_attempt_count":1,"allowed_tools":[],"external_side_effects":false},"offer_id":"offer_239a3e3f4c8a3468da674dfa","cost_class":"ANONYMOUS_FREE","runtime_id":"kilo-gateway","canonical_model_id":"laguna-s-2.1","independence_key":"laguna